{"id":"feier","lemma":"Feier","pos":"noun","rank":2145,"glosses":["celebration","party","ceremony"],"ipa":"/ˈfa̯ɪɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e3/De-Feier.ogg/De-Feier.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Feier","plural":"Feiern"},"formAudio":{"Feiern":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Feiern.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich kam zu spät zur Feier.","en":"I arrived late for the celebration.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567055","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"late"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Gehst du heute zur Feier?","en":"Are you going to the party today?","words":[{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"today"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Es war eine nette Feier.","en":"It was a nice party.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"nice","l":"nett"},null]},{"text":"Wer gibt die Feier?","en":"Who will host the party?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Weißt du, ob er zur Feier kommt?","en":"Do you know if he's coming to the party?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"whether, if"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"}]}]}